        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mix of <strong>cards</strong> and game board for hours of <strong>free fun</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear, uncluttered menus offer a wealth of possibilities:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- a<strong> tutorial</strong> to learn the rules at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- play <strong>solo</strong> against 1 or up to 4 opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 2 <strong>expansions</strong> to renew the way you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- a <strong>multiplayer</strong> mode to play as a family or take on opponents from all over the world.<br><br><u><strong>GamePlay :</strong></u><br><u><strong></strong></u><br><strong>Chakras</strong> are scattered around the game board.<u><strong></strong></u><br><br>To move, 3 types of cards are available:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- &quot;Yin&quot; to move backwards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- &quot;Yang&quot; to move forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- &quot;Karma&quot; to interact with your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each chakra collected on the element circles (Wood, Fire, Earth, Metal, Water) makes you a Master of that element.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first Master of 5 elements wins the game.</p>",
